      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In the Utah climate, a roof lasts anywhere from 15 to 70+ years, depending heavily on the material, high-altitude UV exposure, freeze-thaw cycles, and heavy winter snow loads.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "15 to 70+ years"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Lifespan by Roof Material"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "3-Tab Asphalt Shingles: 15 to 20 years"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Architectural / Dimensional Shingles: 25 to 30 years"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Metal Roofing: 40 to 70 years"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Clay or Concrete Tile: 50 to 100 years"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Utah Climate Factors That Affect Your Roof"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "High-Altitude UV Rays: Intense mountain sunlight breaks down asphalt shingle granules faster than in lower-elevation or cloudier regions."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Freeze-Thaw Cycles: Melting snow refreezing into ice along eaves can cause water backup, structural strain, and accelerated wear."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Snow Loads: Heavy winter accumulation tests the structural integrity of the roof and fasteners, making good attic ventilation and snow-shedding critical."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Gradual Aging: Unlike storm-heavy regions where a single event destroys a roof, Utah roofs typically age gradually through brittleness and granule loss before actual leaks start."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What your current roof is made of"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "How old the roof is"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "What symptoms (like granule loss, curling shingles, or leaks) you are noticing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you figure out if it is time for a repair or a full replacement."
      }
